        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an office inside an abandoned asylum. You don’t know how you got there… but you do know who wants you there: a deranged mind obsessed with forcing victims into “games” designed to break them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, his inspiration is a twisted homage to his favorite series. Five nights. Cameras that don’t always show the truth. Enemies that seem motionless… until they’re not. And a Host who sees everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night is a trial. Every rule, a trap. And every second you survive is an invitation for the game to become even more personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you win… or will you simply last longer than the others?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 5 nights of extreme psychological tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor tampered cameras that hide crucial movements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face human enemies with unpredictable behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the macabre backstory of the Host and his “games.”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oppressive atmosphere in an abandoned asylum filled with unsettling details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 special nights lasting <strong>6 real-time hours</strong> each.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942120/extras/e359bf9cf4e2cd4415da3601e9fbfe9b.poster.avif?t=1760658311\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942120/extras/e359bf9cf4e2cd4415da3601e9fbfe9b.webm?t=1760658311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942120/extras/e359bf9cf4e2cd4415da3601e9fbfe9b.mp4?t=1760658311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Information and Recommendations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Twisted Games</i>, every decision matters and every second you hesitate could be your last. This is not a shooter or an action-packed game: here, psychological tension is your worst enemy… and your only defense is vigilance and resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recommendations:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with headphones.</strong> Directional audio will warn you about things you won’t see on screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay calm.</strong> Jump scares are inevitable, but panicking will lead to mistakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe patterns.</strong> Some enemies move in predictable ways, others act completely at random. Learn to tell them apart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do not neglect Camera 8.</strong> You don’t need to know why… just do it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your power wisely.</strong> Closing doors and checking cameras consumes resources. Overuse will leave you defenseless.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pay attention to visual details.</strong> The Host leaves clues in the cameras and the environment… even if you’d rather not see them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play in the dark.</strong> For the full experience, turn off the lights and let the asylum surround you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong><br>This game contains disturbing images and sounds, and is not recommended for players sensitive to intense horror environments, jump scares, or prolonged psychological tension.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in an office inside an abandoned asylum. You don’t know how you got there… but you do know who wants you there: a deranged mind obsessed with forcing victims into “games” designed to break them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, his inspiration is a twisted homage to his favorite series. Five nights. Cameras that don’t always show the truth. Enemies that seem motionless… until they’re not. And a Host who sees everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night is a trial. Every rule, a trap. And every second you survive is an invitation for the game to become even more personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you win… or will you simply last longer than the others?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 5 nights of extreme psychological tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor tampered cameras that hide crucial movements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face human enemies with unpredictable behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the macabre backstory of the Host and his “games.”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oppressive atmosphere in an abandoned asylum filled with unsettling details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 special nights lasting <strong>6 real-time hours</strong> each.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942120/extras/e359bf9cf4e2cd4415da3601e9fbfe9b.poster.avif?t=1760658311\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942120/extras/e359bf9cf4e2cd4415da3601e9fbfe9b.webm?t=1760658311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942120/extras/e359bf9cf4e2cd4415da3601e9fbfe9b.mp4?t=1760658311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Information and Recommendations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Twisted Games</i>, every decision matters and every second you hesitate could be your last. This is not a shooter or an action-packed game: here, psychological tension is your worst enemy… and your only defense is vigilance and resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recommendations:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with headphones.</strong> Directional audio will warn you about things you won’t see on screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay calm.</strong> Jump scares are inevitable, but panicking will lead to mistakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe patterns.</strong> Some enemies move in predictable ways, others act completely at random. Learn to tell them apart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do not neglect Camera 8.</strong> You don’t need to know why… just do it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your power wisely.</strong> Closing doors and checking cameras consumes resources. Overuse will leave you defenseless.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pay attention to visual details.</strong> The Host leaves clues in the cameras and the environment… even if you’d rather not see them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play in the dark.</strong> For the full experience, turn off the lights and let the asylum surround you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning:</strong><br>This game contains disturbing images and sounds, and is not recommended for players sensitive to intense horror environments, jump scares, or prolonged psychological tension.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "&quot;Twisted Games&quot; locks you in an abandoned asylum turned into a mentally ill attraction. Survive five nights watching altered cameras, while unpredictable enemies lurk in the darkness. This might sound familiar... the host knows.",
